 "description": "The Vocality ROIP and DTECH M3-SE-MFGW appliances are networked C4ISR solutions for defense, intelligence, security, and commercial missions. The Vocality RoIP appliance provides users with a simple-to-use, small form factor radio gateway solution that allows the connection of legacy push-to-talk and digital radio systems to IP unicast and multicast networks via either Ethernet or an embedded 4G LTE modem. The DTECH M3-SE MFGW offers the capabilities of the ROIP product, but in DTECH’s SE product line which boasts a ruggedized form factor and robust modular power solutions.",
